Magnus Lindholm (8):
  sparc64: disassociate MSI descriptors after IRQ teardown
  sparc64: initialize MSI dispatch before requesting queue IRQs
  sparc64: retain published MSI queues on initialization failure
  sparc64: synchronize MSI queue dispatch before releasing IRQs
  sparc64: check MSI invalidation before completing teardown
  sparc64: validate and order MSI queue consumption
  sparc64: quarantine MSI IDs after failed hardware teardown
  sparc64: stage MSI queue enable after handler registration

